WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.320
This is Nuits Receipts,
a receipt inbox you deploy yourself.

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:09.180
It's open source, and it runs on
Cloudflare Workers, in your own account.

3
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.450
Forward receipts by email,
or upload PDFs and photos, ten at a time.

4
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:18.750
It reads the seller, date,
total and VAT, next to the original.

5
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.010
Anything unsure waits
in Receipts, under To do.

6
00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:25.380
This parking slip has no year,
so it asks for the date.

7
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:30.560
Then import your bank statement,
as XLSX, CSV or PDF.

8
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.450
It finds the account
and the columns itself.

9
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.750
Payments with a receipt
match automatically.

10
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:40.280
Tax and bank fees are set aside,
and missing ones are listed.

11
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.950
New: select many rows, then match
them or set them aside in one go.

12
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.580
Home takes the month in three steps:
check, match, send.

13
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:51.780
You get a ZIP and a CSV
for your accountant.

14
00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.580
Check them before you send them.

15
00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.360
The code is on GitHub, under Apache 2.0.

